# Attitudes Towards the World Language Problem as Shown by 'Q-Methodology'

**Authors:** Emmart, B. D.

## Abstract
The article reports on an enquiry conducted by Edward Pteisser in the United States, in April, 1972, to investigate attitudes towards implementation and use of an international language. A research methodology is presented, including a sample of statements to be judged by respondents, and recommendations based on results are made. Available from Humanities Press, Inc., Atlantic Highlands, NJ 07716. (CLK)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ122797

